      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 55
    },
    {
      "displayText": "And there it goes.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǤ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 412,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0041006E006400200074006800650072006500200069007400200067006F00650073002E00100002011401E40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "My Jolteon is just far too hasty by nature.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǤ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 460,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D00790020004A006F006C00740065006F006E0020006900730020006A007500730074002000660061007200200074006F006F0020006800610073007400790020006200790020006E00610074007500720065002E00100002011401E40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 48
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Even the slightest hint of battling in my\nPokémon’s future sends it running in a flash<U+0010><U+0001>븀\ntoward the nearest battle court.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǤ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 556,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 127
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Now that my Jolteon’s got its hopes up, I’d hate\nto let it down. Will you help me out and battle us?<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nI’ll be waiting for you at the battle court!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǤ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 812,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 153
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1120,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Hey! You’ll battle us, right?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǤ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1132,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004800650079002100200059006F00752019006C006C00200062006100740074006C0065002000750073002C002000720069006700680074003F00100002011401E40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Jah!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1200,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004A0061006800210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oh, come on! You haven’t even given h<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿȂimer a\nchance to respond!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǤ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1212,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F0068002C00200063006F006D00650020006F006E002100200059006F007500200068006100760065006E201900740020006500760065006E00200067006900760065006E0020006800100003110000FF02020069006D0065007200200061000A006300680061006E0063006500200074006F00200072006500730070006F006E0064002100100002011401E40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 72
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1356,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "That strength is just what I’d expect of Team MZ!\nYou’re the real deal.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǤ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1368,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 76
    },
    {
      "displayText": "But you have to admit—Jolteon and the rest of my\nteam were fast, right? Their Hasty Natures help!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǤ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1520,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 102
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Some Pokémon’s Natures can make them even\nfaster in battle.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǤ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1724,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0053006F006D006500200050006F006B00E9006D006F006E201900730020004E006100740075007200650073002000630061006E0020006D0061006B00650020007400680065006D0020006500760065006E000A00660061007300740065007200200069006E00200062006100740074006C0065002E00100002011401E40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 64
    },
    {
      "displayText": "A Hasty Nature will do that, of course—but the\nsame goes for a Timid, Jolly, or Naive Nature!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǤ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1852,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 98
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Being speedier helps a Pokémon out because it’ll\ntake less time between moves.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǤ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2048,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 83
    },
    {
      "displayText": "But even the fastest Pokémon in the world would\nstill need about three seconds to reuse a move.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǤ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2216,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 100
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oh, and then you also have to consider—<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǤ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2416,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F0068002C00200061006E00640020007400680065006E00200079006F007500200061006C0073006F0020006800610076006500200074006F00200063006F006E00730069006400650072201400100002011401E40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Jah!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2504,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004A0061006800210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Hey, now! Don’t run off to the Pokémon Center\nwithout me!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǤ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 2516,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004800650079002C0020006E006F0077002100200044006F006E20190074002000720075006E0020006F0066006600200074006F002000740068006500200050006F006B00E9006D006F006E002000430065006E007400650072000A0077006900740068006F007500740020006D0065002100100002011401E40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 62
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Guess I gotta dash! Thanks and bye!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǤ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
